  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Displaced and Crisis Affected Populations in Cameroon&apos;s Far North, North-West, and South-West Regions For Recovery and Resilience Building For Humanitarian Development Peace NEXUS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian needs in Cameroon remain high. According to the Humanitarian Response Plan (HRP) published in March 2023, approximately 4.7 million people are in need of emergency assistance with three humanitarian fronts (Far North Region, North-West, South-West (NWSW) and East Regions). This project provides a fourth phase in Cameroon for IOM to build community resilience and recovery to save lives in Cameroon&#x2019;s crisis areas of Far North and NWSW.</narrative>
  </description>
